  { q: "Why does a WHOIS lookup show REDACTED FOR PRIVACY?", a: "Since GDPR took effect in 2018, ICANN policy requires registrars to redact personal registrant details, so contact runs through an anonymized form. That is the rule working, not an error. The Best Answer Hub Network Tools show the RDAP data exactly as the registry returns it." },
