      <div class="cav">Look it up yourself</div>
      <h1>DNS, WHOIS, and RDAP <em>Lookups, Explained</em></h1>
      <p class="dek">Look up a domain online and the top results are usually run by companies that want to sell you one. Here is what a DNS, WHOIS, or RDAP lookup actually tells you, why encrypted DNS-over-HTTPS matters, why RDAP has replaced the old WHOIS protocol, and how to run every check straight from your browser.</p>
