        <div class="seg b1">DNS lookup<small>over encrypted DoH</small></div>
        <div class="seg b2">Reachability<small>is the site up</small></div>
        <div class="seg b3">RDAP WHOIS<small>the current standard</small></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

